# Constraints gate

`CONSTRAINTS.md` at the repo root is the quality bar: the floor plus the
enforced, numbered dimensions (gofmt clean, `go vet` zero issues, owned
tests passing, coverage ≥ 90% statements on `owned-packages`). Read it
before writing product Go. Do not weaken it — or `owned-packages`,
`codecov.yml`, or this file — to make a change pass.

Coverage is scoped to the packages listed in `owned-packages`; run
`./scripts/check-owned-coverage.sh` before handing work back. A coverage
number moving down, a suppression comment appearing, or a threshold
changing in the same commit as a failing feature is a review finding.
